<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14770" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dōtālis</span></b> , e,
			adj.
		dos, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a dowry</i> or <i>portion</i> (of the wife, and sometimes of the
			husband), <i>dotal</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aedes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Mil. 4, 4, 30</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">4, 6, 63</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praedia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 15, 20, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">regia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 9, 737</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">11, 369</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">regnum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					4, 705</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. F. 6, 593</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">patria,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. M.
					8, 67</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tellus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. H.
					4, 163</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">agri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 6, 21</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arma,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					17, 75</span></i>
			 et saep.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">servus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. As. 1, 1, 72</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Dig. 24, 1, 28</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sen.
				Contr. 3, 21</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tyrii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 4, 104</span></i>
			.</div>
